          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/caldera-dutch-coals/200/250" alt="Ember Dutch Oven in coals" width="200" height="250" loading="lazy" />
          <div>
            <p class="cart-xsell__name">Ember Dutch Oven 5.5qt</p>
            <p class="cart-xsell__variant">5.5 qt / Bare iron &middot; Qty 1</p>
          </div>
          <p class="cart-xsell__amount">$165</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <dl class="cart-xsell__totals">
        <div><dt>Subtotal</dt><dd>$165.00</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Shipping</dt><dd>Free</dd></div>
      </dl>
